{"title":"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alice is making a batch of cookies and needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/326ffd5dad575b516107379241a09d601078a88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> cups of sugar.  Unfortunately, her measuring cup holds only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> cup of sugar.  How many times must she fill that cup to get the correct amount of sugar?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b491a5c863083566ff76da7069ca24a4d4c2efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10  \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To get how many cups we need, we realize that we simply need to divide the number of cups needed by the number of cups collected in her measuring cup each time.  Thus, we need to evaluate the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/277c2e99f8ab8e0a12c8dfdcb3b96f8a0e53ed28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"22\" height=\"47\" />.  Simplifying, this is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39f30df0755fd32a583a6cc187974fa481a6ef0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2}(4) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/yjRXkJJ6Vg0\">https://youtu.be/yjRXkJJ6Vg0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/E-9k3t6AQ68\">https://youtu.be/E-9k3t6AQ68</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A\">2013 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"